   - Share the link to the official page.

2. What you may not do
   - Re-upload, mirror, redistribute, sell or rent the Software or its installer files
     anywhere else (other websites, file-sharing services, app stores, package managers).
   - Modify the Software, or distribute a modified version.
   - Unpack, copy or reuse its source code, pixel art, characters or other assets
     in another product.
   - Use the name "Kit Commit" or its characters for another app or service,
